     1,
     "<div>None, because lavaan is using probit regression, not logistic regression.  However, the same basic idea as McKelvey &amp; Zavoina&#39;s is what lavaan reports.<br></div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424425389000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20RD7pHMePbI8sigCwnged\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div></div><div><br></div>"
